      <title>Apollo9.0 构建</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/01/Apollo/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/01/Apollo/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="配置问题"><a href="#配置问题" class="headerlink" title="配置问题"></a>配置问题</h2><p>如果是40系列显卡，Apollo8.0 及以前已经不再支持。Apollo9.0有针对40系显卡驱动的补丁，可以勉强使用。如果想使用8.0及以前版本，建议30系列及以前显卡。</p><h2 id="确定已经安装Docker三件套"><a href="#确定已经安装Docker三件套" class="headerlink" title="确定已经安装Docker三件套"></a>确定已经安装Docker三件套</h2><p>Docker、Docker-compose以及NVIDIA Container Toolkit安装</p><h2 id="Build-Apollo"><a href="#Build-Apollo" class="headerlink" title="Build Apollo"></a>Build Apollo</h2><h4 id="clone-apollo-9-0"><a href="#clone-apollo-9-0" class="headerlink" title="clone apollo 9.0"></a>clone apollo 9.0</h4><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">git</span> clone <span class="token parameter variable">-b</span> v9.0.0 <span class="token operator">&lt;</span>https://github.com/ApolloAuto/apollo.git<span class="token operator">&gt;</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作"><a href="#由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作" class="headerlink" title="由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作"></a>由于40系显卡的原因，需要特殊操作</h5><blockquote><p><a href="https://apollo.baidu.com/community/article/1212">40系列显卡新镜像支持_Apollo开发者社区</a></p></blockquote><h5 id="dev-start-sh成功会提示"><a href="#dev-start-sh成功会提示" class="headerlink" title="dev_start.sh成功会提示"></a>dev_start.sh成功会提示</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token punctuation">[</span> OK <span class="token punctuation">]</span> Congratulations<span class="token operator">!</span> You have successfully finished setting up Apollo Dev Environment.<span class="token punctuation">[</span> OK <span class="token punctuation">]</span> To login into the newly created apollo_dev_lei container, please run the following command:<span class="token punctuation">[</span> OK <span class="token punctuation">]</span>   <span class="token function">bash</span> docker/scripts/dev_into.sh<span class="token punctuation">[</span> OK <span class="token punctuation">]</span> Enjoy<span class="token operator">!</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="进入容器"><a href="#进入容器" class="headerlink" title="进入容器"></a>进入容器</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">bash docker/scripts/dev_into.sh<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="构建"><a href="#构建" class="headerlink" title="构建"></a>构建</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">./apollo.sh build_gpu<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="成功会提示"><a href="#成功会提示" class="headerlink" title="成功会提示"></a>成功会提示</h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span> OK <span class="token punctuation">]</span> Done building apollo. Enjoy<span class="token operator">!</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span class="token operator">==</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="Dreamview，启动"><a href="#Dreamview，启动" class="headerlink" title="Dreamview，启动"></a><strong>Dreamview，启动</strong></h5><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">./scripts/bootstrap.sh<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><h5 id="根据提示进入Dreamview"><a href="#根据提示进入Dreamview" class="headerlink" title="根据提示进入Dreamview"></a>根据提示进入Dreamview</h5><p>Apollo9.0是</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">http://localhost:8899/<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
